  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the council might start fining people for leaving bins out past 8am, but who knows if that’s actually true. Seems like just another unnecessary rule if they decide to go through with it.",
   "author": 3,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "soften",
